Overrides `fetchRetryFactor` / `fetch-retry-factor` from `.npmrc` / `aube-workspace.yaml` when set. Integer-only — the underlying `FetchPolicy.retry_factor` is `u32`. Fractional values like `1.5` are rejected by clap.
"""#
        arg <N>
